# Gather the White Lotus with no Plains: the count is zero, so no token is created (CR 111.1) and the scry 2 still happens.
# Bot1 pays {4}{W} with Black Lotus, Mox Pearl and Mox Emerald (and an Island played to be a land that is no Plains) and
# keeps the Mountain on top while the Swamp goes to the bottom.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Gather the White Lotus
Island
Forest
Forest
Swamp
Mountain
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gather the White Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Mountain | Swamp)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Pearl; Mox Emerald
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Forest; Mountain
